{"title":"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Based on the graph shown, which sport is played by the most students?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad4f90ebadd06bef61ff0095fdc64bbe8256dec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{hockey} \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{basketball} \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{soccer} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{volleyball} \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{badminton}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"619\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the bar graph, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/7/78792fe4680a164f537ea72a4f900e4471433c3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students play hockey, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students play basketball, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/6/906734e2f1010e9a171ffee8050cbc0649cea37c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students play soccer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students play volleyball, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> students play badminton. Thus, the sport played by the most students is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de72b8555a32c34b3df7b070f33c8f2f2ba338ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\text{soccer}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"92\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Without_Looking_at_Values.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Without_Looking_at_Values)\">Solution 2 (Without Looking at Values)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Without Looking at Values)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sport that is played the most will go the highest on the bar graph. Inspecting the bar graph, we see that this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de72b8555a32c34b3df7b070f33c8f2f2ba338ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } \\text{soccer}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"92\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2017 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a hre